              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio babaandu be chikholo abo basaaya Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, ne lundi bakholela bifwaani. Ne lisaaye liabwe basichiililila khukhola busa bario khukhwola luno.",
          "type": "text",
